{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N6oqN2BFaLZzQfxHtxixJe","type":"tool_result","content":"76104\tclass PostProcessing {\n76105\t\n76106\t\t/**\n76107\t\t * Constructs a new post processing management module.\n76108\t\t *\n76109\t\t * @param {Renderer} renderer - A reference to the renderer.\n76110\t\t * @param {Node<vec4>} outputNode - An optional output node.\n76111\t\t */\n76112\t\tconstructor( renderer, outputNode = vec4( 0, 0, 1, 1 ) ) {\n76113\t\n76114\t\t\t/**\n76115\t\t\t * A reference to the renderer.\n76116\t\t\t *\n76117\t\t\t * @type {Renderer}\n76118\t\t\t */\n76119\t\t\tthis.renderer = renderer;\n76120\t\n76121\t\t\t/**\n76122\t\t\t * A node which defines the final output of the post\n76123\t\t\t * processing. This is usually the last node in a chain\n76124\t\t\t * of effect nodes.\n76125\t\t\t *\n76126\t\t\t * @type {Node<vec4>}\n76127\t\t\t */\n76128\t\t\tthis.outputNode = outputNode;\n76129\t\n76130\t\t\t/**\n76131\t\t\t * Whether the default output tone mapping and color\n76132\t\t\t * space transformation should be enabled or not.\n76133\t\t\t *\n76134\t\t\t * It is enabled by default by it must be disabled when\n76135\t\t\t * effects must be executed after tone mapping and color\n76136\t\t\t * space conversion. A typical example is FXAA which\n76137\t\t\t * requires sRGB input.\n76138\t\t\t *\n76139\t\t\t * When set to `false`, the app must control the output\n76140\t\t\t * transformation with `RenderOutputNode`.\n76141\t\t\t *\n76142\t\t\t * ```js\n76143\t\t\t * const outputPass = renderOutput( scenePass );\n76144\t\t\t * ```\n76145\t\t\t *\n76146\t\t\t * @type {boolean}\n76147\t\t\t */\n76148\t\t\tthis.outputColorTransform = true;\n76149\t\n76150\t\t\t/**\n76151\t\t\t * Must be set to `true` when the output node changes.\n76152\t\t\t *\n76153\t\t\t * @type {Node<vec4>}\n76154\t\t\t */\n76155\t\t\tthis.needsUpdate = true;\n76156\t\n76157\t\t\tconst material = new NodeMaterial();\n76158\t\t\tmaterial.name =