friction).setRestitution(0).setCollisionGroups((4 << 16) | 0xffff), b);\n      b.hh = hh; stones.push(b); placed++;\n    }\n    const prog = Math.min(1, t / total);\n    const sw = sway[0] + (sway[1] - sway[0]) * prog, tr = tremor[0] + (tremor[1] - tremor[0]) * prog;\n    const uu = up(body.rotation()); lx = Math.atan2(uu.x, uu.y); lz = Math.atan2(uu.z, uu.y);\n    const w = body.angvel();\n    const maxL = rad(18), dot = { x: lx / maxL, y: lz / maxL };\n    buf.push(dot); while (buf.length > Math.max(1, Math.round(delay * 120))) buf.shift();\n    let ax = gain * -buf[0].x + noise * Math.sin(t * 2.7 + seed), az = gain * -buf[0].y + noise * Math.sin(t * 2.1 + seed * 2);\n    const r10 = 1 - Math.exp(-10 / 120); wx += (ax - wx) * r10; wz += (az - wz) * r10;\n    const tx = wx * maxL, tz = wz * maxL;\n    let Tx = -(G * Math.sin(tx) + K * (lx - tx)) - D * -w.z, Tz = -(G * Math.sin(tz) + K * (lz - tz)) - D * w.x;\n    const m = Math.hypot(Tx, Tz); if (m > tau) { Tx *= tau / m; Tz *= tau / m; }\n    const nx = sw * (Math.sin(t * 0.9 + seed) * 0.6 + Math.sin(t * 1.73 + seed * 2.1) * 0.4) + tr * (Math.sin(t * 8.2 + 1.1) * 0.6 + Math.sin(t * 18.3) * 0.4);\n    const nz = sw * (Math.sin(t * 0.77 + seed * 1.7) * 0.6 + Math.sin(t * 1.51 + seed * 0.6) * 0.4) + tr * (Math.sin(t * 7.1 + 2.3) * 0.6 + Math.sin(t * 15.7 + 0.7) * 0.4);\n    body.resetTorques(true); body.addTorque(V(Tz + nz, -w.y * 0.6, -(Tx + nx)), true);\n    world.step();\n    peak = Math.max(peak, Math.hypot(lx, lz));\n    if (firstLoss === null && stones.some((st) => st.translation().y < 1.3)) firstLoss = t.toFixed(1) + 's@' + placed;\n    if (peak > rad(45)) break;\n  }\n  const on = stones.filter((st) => st.translation().y > 1.3).length;\n  world.free();\n  return `${on}/${placed} pk${Math.round(deg(peak))} loss ${firstLoss}`;\n}\nconst show = (name, cfg) => console.log(name.padEnd(46), [1, 2, 3].map((seed) => run({ seed, ...cfg })).join(' | '));\nconsole.log('--- no disturbance, stick centred');\nshow('regular