 average 0% 16s f0.0 | clumsy 0% 16s f0.0\n  T3 foe .55 ease 8 s    stick 0.9 sharp 0% 19s f0.0 | average 0% 19s f0.0 | clumsy 0% 17s f0.0\n  T3 foe .55 ease 8 s    stick 1 sharp 0% 23s f0.0 | average 0% 22s f0.0 | clumsy 0% 20s f0.0\nSTILL WATER: time in calm zone %, peak calm, calm at end (creatures at .2 .4 .6 .8 1)\n  T1 zone .18 sway .05-.14   sharp 100% peak 1.00 end 1.00 f0.0 | average 98% peak 1.00 end 0.98 f0.0 | clumsy 96% peak 1.00 end 0.89 f0.0\n  T2 zone .15 sway .07-.18   sharp 100% peak 1.00 end 1.00 f0.0 | average 94% peak 1.00 end 0.93 f0.0 | clumsy 75% peak 0.60 end 0.08 f0.0\n  T3 zone .12 sway .1-.22    sharp 86% peak 0.97 end 0.53 f0.0 | average 74% peak 0.58 end 0.03 f0.0 | clumsy 48% peak 0.15 end 0.05 f0.0","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PjWon7DKHf4XgbHUceiWai","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
