{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjETPPPfzj7wGe4kinDu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The hook raises some real points and some that I can't honestly satisfy. Here's how I see each one:\n\n- **Real gaps I can close:**\n  - The plan-stage Testing and Source Information answers aren't in the plan, and the \"Testing\" field isn't filled in with the actual parameters.\n  - Coverage rests on keyword checks. The stronger fix is a build-time proof for every requirement, plus an actual integration prototype built from the plan's own recipes.\n  - I never simulated keyboard or mouse, even though `TASK.md` wants them to feel native, and several events are only partly simulated. Audio can be checked as signals, which is the stand-in `TASK.md` itself names.\n- **Things I can't do and won't fake:** there's no real controller or TV, I can't hear audio, and this stage has no game build. `TASK.md` says anything needing the real hardware is \"checked as far as it can be here, never required\". An About screen for a shipped game belongs to the build stage, though a prototype can prove the mechanism works.\n\nI'll start with keyboard parity, which may be a real design hole."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4693,"cache_read_input_tokens":599584,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4693},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"19307802-7215-43fb-a84b-6c94bbc636c5","uuid":"cb8a497e-aaf3-412b-bb08-1ec9b8222a65","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:32:58.796Z","request_id":"req_011CgjETP4YZ6Ch5PA8KuqFg"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjETPPPfzj7wGe4kinDu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01A2kj4sgoTphJmK868QJY5b","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"mkdir -p /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211905__xe6f2a4/work/_scratch/sim && cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211905__xe6f2a4/work/_scratch/sim && npm init -y >/dev/null && npm i --no-audit --no-fund @dimforge/rapier3d-compat@0.19.3 2>&1 | tail -1 && cat > bal.mjs <<'EOF'\nimport RAPIER from '@dimforge/rapier3d-compat';\nawait RAPIER.init();\nexport { RAPIER };\nexport const V = (x = 0, y = 0, z = 0) => ({ x, y, z });\nexport const rad = (d) => (d * Math.PI) / 180, deg = (r) => (r * 180) / Math.PI;\nexport function rng(a) { a >>>= 0; return () => { a = (a + 0x6d2b79f5) >>> 0; let t = a; t = Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 15), t | 1); t ^= t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), t | 61); return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296; }; }\nexport const DOLL = (0x0100 << 16) | 0x0010, PROP = (0x0010 << 16) | 0x0111, GROUND = (0x0001 << 16) | 0x0010;\nexport function makeWorld(iter = 8) { const w = new RAPIER.World(V(0, -9.81, 0)); w.timestep = 1 / 120; w.integrationParameters.numSolverIterations = iter; return w; }\nexport function makeBalancer(world, { margin = 0.45, zeta = 0.4, ankleMax = 4.6, maxLeanDeg = 18, reflex = 10, ph = 1 } = {}) {\n  const footBody = world.createRigidBody(RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.kinematicPositionBased());\n  const body = world.createRigidBody(RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.dynamic().setTranslation(0, 0.75, 0).setCanSleep(false).setAdditionalSolverIterations(4));\n  world.createCollider(RAPIER.ColliderDesc.capsule(0.5, 0.25).setMass(1).setCollisionGroups(DOLL), body);\n  world.createImpulseJoint(RAPIER.JointData.spherical(V(), V(0, -0.75, 0)), footBody, body, true).setContactsEnabled(false);\n  const G = 9.81 * 0.75, I = 0.75 * 0.75 + 0.06, K = G * (1 + margin), wn = Math.sqrt((K - G) / I), D = 2 * zeta * wn * I;\n  return { world, footBody, body, G, K, D, ankleMax, maxLean: rad(maxLeanDeg), reflex, ph, wishX: 0, wishZ: 0, wx: 0, wz: 0, leanX: 0, leanZ: 0, sway: 0, tremor: 0, extX: 0, extZ: 0, flailLeft: 0, flailCd: 0, flailBoost: 1.9, t: 0, flails: 0,\n    get cob() { return { x: this.leanX / this.maxLean, y: this.leanZ / this.maxLean }; }, get lean() { return Math.hypot(this.leanX, this.leanZ); } };\n}\nexport function stepBal(b, dt = 1 / 120) {\n  const { body, G, K, D, ph, t, sway, tremor } = b;\n  const r = 1 - Math.exp(-b.reflex * dt);\n  b.wx += (b.wishX - b.wx) * r; b.wz += (b.wishZ - b.wz) * r;\n  const tx = b.wx * b.maxLean, tz = b.wz * b.maxLean;\n  const q = body.rotation();\n  const ux = 2 * (q.x * q.y - q.w * q.z), uy = 1 - 2 * (q.x * q.x + q.z * q.z), uz = 2 * (q.y * q.z + q.w * q.x);\n  b.leanX = Math.atan2(ux, uy); b.leanZ = Math.atan2(uz, uy);\n  const w = body.angvel();\n  let Tx = -(G * Math.sin(tx) + K * (b.leanX - tx)) + D * w.z;\n  let Tz = -(G * Math.sin(tz) + K * (b.leanZ - tz)) - D * w.x;\n  const limit = b.ankleMax * (b.flailLeft > 0 ? b.flailBoost : 1);\n  const m = Math.hypot(Tx, Tz); if (m > limit) { Tx *= limit / m; Tz *= limit / m; }\n  const nx = sway * (Math.sin(t * 0.9 + ph) * 0.6 + Math.sin(t * 1.73 + ph * 2.1) * 0.4) + tremor * (Math.sin(t * 8.2 + 1.1) * 0.6 + Math.sin(t * 18.3) * 0.4) + b.extX;\n  const nz = sway * (Math.sin(t * 0.77 + ph * 1.7) * 0.6 + Math.sin(t * 1.51 + ph * 0.6) * 0.4) + tremor * (Math.sin(t * 7.1 + 2.3) * 0.6 + Math.sin(t * 15.7 + 0.7) * 0.4) + b.extZ;\n  body.resetTorques(true);\n  body.addTorque(V(Tz + nz, -w.y * 0.6, -(Tx + nx)), true);\n  b.flailLeft = Math.max(0, b.flailLeft - dt); b.flailCd = Math.max(0, b.flailCd - dt); b.t += dt;\n}\nexport function flail(b) { if (b.flailCd <= 0) { b.flailLeft = 0.35; b.flailCd = 2; b.flails++; return true; } return false; }\nexport function resetDoll(b) { b.body.setRotation({ x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 1 }, true); const f = b.footBody.translation(); b.body.setTranslation(V(f.x, f.y + 0.75, f.z), true); b.body.setLinvel(V(), true); b.body.setAngvel(V(), true); b.wx = b.wz = 0; }\nexport function human(delay, gain, noise, seed) { const buf = []; let t = 0; return (dot, goal, dt = 1 / 120) => { t += dt; buf.push({ x: dot.x, y: dot.y }); const n = Math.max(1, Math.round(delay / dt)); while (buf.length > n) buf.shift(); const d = buf[0]; return { x: goal.x + gain * (goal.x - d.x) + noise * Math.sin(t * 2.7 + seed), y: goal.y + gain * (goal.y - d.y) + noise * Math.sin(t * 2.1 + seed * 2) }; }; }\nexport const clampDisc = (a) => { const L = Math.hypot(a.x, a.y); return L > 1 ? { x: a.x / L, y: a.y / L } : a; };\nexport const PLAYERS = { sharp: { delay: 0.16, gain: 1.4, noise: 0, lag: 0.12, err: 0.3, jitter: 28 }, average: { delay: 0.26, gain: 1.0, noise: 0.03, lag: 0.28, err: 0.8, jitter: 55 }, clumsy: { delay: 0.38, gain: 0.8, noise: 0.07, lag: 0.5, err: 1.4, jitter: 95 } };\nexport const under = { sharp: { delay: 0.16, gain: 0.7, noise: 0 }, average: { delay: 0.26, gain: 0.55, noise: 0.03 }, clumsy: { delay: 0.38, gain: 0.45, noise: 0.08 } };\nexport const avg = (a) => a.reduce((s, x) => s + x, 0) / a.length;\nEOF\ncat > kb.mjs <<'EOF'\n// Keyboard parity. Two candidate key models, played by a key-pressing bot with a delay and a deadband.\nimport { RAPIER, V, rad, deg, rng, avg, makeWorld, makeBalancer, stepBal, human, clampDisc, PLAYERS, under, DOLL, PROP } from './bal.mjs';\nfunction keys(model) {\n  // returns a function(pressX, pressZ, dt) -> wish; press is -1, 0 or 1 on each axis\n  let x = 0, z = 0;\n  const up = 1 / 0.45, down = 1 / 0.25, nudge = 1.1;\n  const ramp = (v, p, dt) => p !== 0 ? Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, v + p * up * dt)) : (Math.abs(v) < down * dt ? 0 : v - Math.sign(v) * down * dt);\n  return (px, pz, dt) => {\n    if (model === 'ramp') { x = ramp(x, px, dt); z = ramp(z, pz, dt); }\n    else { x = Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, x + px * nudge * dt)); z = Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, z + pz * nudge * dt)); }\n    return { x, y: z };\n  };\n}\nfunction keyBot(skill, model, seed) {\n  const P = PLAYERS[skill], buf = []; let px = 0, pz = 0, cool = 0; const r = rng(seed * 3);\n  const dead = { sharp: 0.035, average: 0.06, clumsy: 0.1 }[skill];\n  const minPress = { sharp: 0.05, average: 0.08, clumsy: 0.11 }[skill];\n  let holdX = 0, holdZ = 0;\n  return (dot, goal, dt) => {\n    buf.push({ x: dot.x, y: dot.y }); while (buf.length > Math.max(1, Math.round(P.delay / dt))) buf.shift(); const d = buf[0];\n    const ex = goal.x - d.x, ez = goal.y - d.y;\n    holdX -= dt; holdZ -= dt;\n    if (holdX <= 0) { const want = Math.abs(ex) > dead ? Math.sign(ex) : 0; if (want !== px) { px = want; holdX = minPress; } }\n    if (holdZ <= 0) { const want = Math.abs(ez) > dead ? Math.sign(ez) : 0; if (want !== pz) { pz = want; holdZ = minPress; } }\n    return [px, pz];\n  };\n}\n// ---- Poses\nconst POSES = [[-0.35, 0], [0, 0.4], [0, -0.35], [0.4, 0], [0.35, 0.2]];\nfunction poses(cfg, skill, seed, input) {\n  const world = makeWorld(8), b = makeBalancer(world, { maxLeanDeg: 14, ph: seed });\n  const P = PLAYERS[skill], stick = human(P.delay, P.gain, P.noise, seed), kbot = keyBot(skill, input, seed), kb = keys(input);\n  let w = 0, mw = 0; const dt = 1 / 120; let from = { x: 0, y: 0 };\n  for (const [gx, gy] of POSES.slice(0, cfg.poses)) {\n    for (let s = 0; s < (3 + cfg.hold) * 120; s++) {\n      const t = s / 120, e0 = Math.min(1, t / 3), e = e0 * e0 * (3 - 2 * e0), goal = { x: from.x + (gx - from.x) * e, y: from.y + (gy - from.y) * e }, dot = b.cob, h = Math.max(0, t - 3), f = Math.min(1, h / cfg.hold);\n      const rr = 0.3 + (cfg.ring - 0.3) * f; b.sway = cfg.sw[0] + (cfg.sw[1] - cfg.sw[0]) * f; b.tremor = cfg.tr[0] + (cfg.tr[1] - cfg.tr[0]) * f;\n      if (input === 'stick') { const a = clampDisc(stick(dot, goal)); b.wishX = a.x; b.wishZ = a.y; } else { const [px, pz] = kbot(dot, goal, dt); const a = clampDisc(kb(px, pz, dt)); b.wishX = a.x; b.wishZ = a.y; }\n      stepBal(b); world.step();\n      const weight = 0.3 / rr; if (t > 1.5) { mw += weight; if (Math.hypot(dot.x - goal.x, dot.y - goal.y) <= rr) w += weight; }\n    }\n    from = { x: gx, y: gy };\n  }\n  world.free(); return (100 * w) / mw;\n}\nconst T1 = { poses: 3, hold: 8, ring: 0.16, sw: [0.08, 0.22], tr: [0.08, 0.2] }, T2 = { poses: 4, hold: 10, ring: 0.13, sw: [0.12, 0.3], tr: [0.1, 0.3] };\nconsole.log('POSES form: stick vs keys');\nfor (const [n, c] of [['T1', T1], ['T2', T2]]) for (const input of ['stick', 'ramp', 'nudge']) console.log(' ', n, input.padEnd(6), ['sharp', 'average', 'clumsy'].map((sk) => `${sk} ${avg([1, 2, 3].map((s) => poses(c, sk, s, input))).toFixed(0)}`).join(' | '));\n// ---- Still Water\nfunction still(cfg, skill, seed, input) {\n  const world = makeWorld(8), b = makeBalancer(world, { ph: seed }); const U = under[skill], stick = human(U.delay, U.gain, U.noise * 0.5, seed), kbot = keyBot(skill, input, seed), kb = keys(input);\n  let calm = 0, zt = 0; const dt = 1 / 120, secs = 60;\n  for (let s = 0; s < secs * 120; s++) {\n    const t = s / 120; b.sway = cfg.sw[0] + (cfg.sw[1] - cfg.sw[0]) * (t / secs); b.tremor = 0.05; const dot = b.cob;\n    if (input === 'stick') { const a = clampDisc(stick(dot, { x: 0, y: 0 })); b.wishX = a.x; b.wishZ = a.y; } else { const [px, pz] = kbot(dot, { x: 0, y: 0 }, dt); const a = clampDisc(kb(px, pz, dt)); b.wishX = a.x; b.wishZ = a.y; }\n    stepBal(b); world.step(); const inZ = Math.hypot(dot.x, dot.y) <= cfg.zone; calm = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, calm + (inZ ? 1 / 30 : -1 / 8) * dt)); if (inZ) zt += dt;\n  }\n  world.free(); return 100 * (zt / secs + calm) / 2;\n}\nconsole.log('STILL WATER T1 form: stick vs keys');\nfor (const input of ['stick', 'ramp', 'nudge']) console.log(' ', input.padEnd(6), ['sharp', 'average', 'clumsy'].map((sk) => `${sk} ${avg([1, 2, 3].map((s) => still({ zone: 0.15, sw: [0.07, 0.18] }, sk, s, input))).toFixed(0)}`).join(' | '));\n// ---- Cairn T2\nconst sizes = [[0.26, 0.09], [0.24, 0.085], [0.22, 0.08], [0.2, 0.078], [0.18, 0.074], [0.165, 0.07], [0.15, 0.066], [0.14, 0.062]];\nfunction cairn(skill, seed, input) {\n  const world = makeWorld(10), b = makeBalancer(world, { margin: 0.8, ankleMax: 6, ph: seed });\n  world.createCollider(RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(0.55, 0.03, 0.55).setTranslation(0, 0.95, 0).setMass(0.05).setFriction(1).setCollisionGroups(DOLL), b.body);\n  const r = rng(seed * 2654435761), U = under[skill], stick = human(U.delay, U.gain, U.noise, seed), kbot = keyBot(skill, input, seed), kb = keys(input), stones = []; let placed = 0, next = 1; const every = 5, count = 8, total = count * every + 11, dt = 1 / 120;\n  for (let s = 0; s < total * 120; s++) {\n    const t = s / 120, f = t / total;\n    if (t >= next && placed < count) { next += every; const [r0, hh] = sizes[placed]; const q = b.body.rotation(), p = b.body.translation(); const ux = 2 * (q.x * q.y - q.w * q.z), uy = 1 - 2 * (q.x * q.x + q.z * q.z), uz = 2 * (q.y * q.z + q.w * q.x); const sl = { x: p.x + ux * 0.98, y: p.y + uy * 0.98, z: p.z + uz * 0.98 }; const live = stones.filter((st) => st.translation().y > 1.3); const top = live.length ? live.reduce((m, st) => (st.translation().y > m.translation().y ? st : m)) : null; const y = (top ? top.translation().y + top.hh : sl.y) + hh + 0.012, cx = top ? top.translation().x : sl.x, cz = top ? top.translation().z : sl.z;\n      const d = world.createRigidBody(RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.dynamic().setTranslation(cx + (r() - 0.5) * 0.04, y, cz + (r() - 0.5) * 0.04).setLinearDamping(0.1).setAngularDamping(0.6).setCanSleep(false)); world.createCollider(RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(r0 * 0.8, hh, r0 * 0.8).setMass(0.02).setFriction(0.95).setRestitution(0).setCollisionGroups(PROP), d); d.hh = hh; stones.push(d); placed++; }\n    b.sway = 0.15 + 0.25 * f; b.tremor = 0.08 + 0.12 * f; const dot = b.cob;\n    if (input === 'stick') { const a = clampDisc(stick(dot, { x: 0, y: 0 })); b.wishX = a.x; b.wishZ = a.y; } else { const [px, pz] = kbot(dot, { x: 0, y: 0 }, dt); const a = clampDisc(kb(px, pz, dt)); b.wishX = a.x; b.wishZ = a.y; }\n    stepBal(b); world.step();\n  }\n  const on = stones.filter((st) => st.translation().y > 1.3).length; world.free(); return on;\n}\nconsole.log('CAIRN T2 stones of 8, no breath: stick vs keys');\nfor (const input of ['stick', 'ramp', 'nudge']) console.log(' ', input.padEnd(6), ['sharp', 'average', 'clumsy'].map((sk) => `${sk} ${avg([1, 2, 3].map((s) => cairn(sk, s, input))).toFixed(1)}`).join(' | '));\nEOF\nnode kb.mjs 2>&1 | grep -v deprecated","description":"Simulate keyboard weight control against the stick","timeout":420000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4693,"cache_read_input_tokens":599584,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4693},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"19307802-7215-43fb-a84b-6c94bbc636c5","uuid":"bf9affe3-bc52-468d-a901-7f13c74be5c0","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:33:45.328Z","request_id":"req_011CgjETP4YZ6Ch5PA8KuqFg","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01A2kj4sgoTphJmK868QJY5b":{"command":"mkdir -p /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211905__xe6f2a4/work/_scratch/sim && cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211905__xe6f2a4/work/_scratch/sim && npm init -y >/dev/null && npm i --no-audit --no-fund @dimforge/rapier3d-compat@0.19.3 2>&1 | tail -1 && cat > bal.mjs <<'EOF'\nimport RAPIER from '@dimforge/rapier3d-compat';\nawait RAPIER.init();\nexport { RAPIER };\nexport const V = (x = 0, y = 0, z = 0) => ({ x, y, z });\nexport const rad = (d) => (d * Math.PI) / 180, deg = (r) => (r * 180) / Math.PI;\nexport function rng(a) { a >>>= 0; return () => { a = (a + 0x6d2b79f5) >>> 0; let t = a; t = Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 15), t | 1); t ^= t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), t | 61); return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296; }; }\nexport const DOLL = (0x0100 << 16) | 0x0010, PROP = (0x0010 << 16) | 0x0111, GROUND = (0x0001 << 16) | 0x0010;\nexport function makeWorld(iter = 8) { const w = new RAPIER.World(V(0, -9.81, 0)); w.timestep = 1 / 120; w.integrationParameters.numSolverIterations = iter; return w; }\nexport function makeBalancer(world, { margin = 0.45, zeta = 0.4, ankleMax = 4.6, maxLeanDeg = 18, reflex = 10, ph = 1 } = {}) {\n  const footBody = world.createRigidBody(RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.kinematicPositionBased());\n  const body = world.createRigidBody(RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.dynamic().setTranslation(0, 0.75, 0).setCanSleep(false).setAdditionalSolverIterations(4));\n  world.createCollider(RAPIER.ColliderDesc.capsule(0.5, 0.25).setMass(1).setCollisionGroups(DOLL), body);\n  world.createImpulseJoint(RAPIER.JointData.spherical(V(), V(0, -0.75, 0)), footBody, body, true).setContactsEnabled(false);\n  const G = 9.81 * 0.75, I = 0.75 * 0.75 + 0.06, K = G * (1 + margin), wn = Math.sqrt((K - G) / I), D = 2 * zeta * wn * I;\n  return { world, footBody, body, G, K, D, ankleMax, maxLean: rad(maxLeanDeg), reflex, ph, wishX: 0, wishZ: 0, wx: 0, wz: 0, leanX: 0, leanZ: 0, sway: 0, tremor: 0, extX: 0, extZ: 0, flailLeft: 0, flailCd: 0, flailBoost: 1.9, t: 0, flails: 0,\n    get cob() { return { x: this.leanX / this.maxLean, y: this.leanZ / this.maxLean }; }, get lean() { return Math.hypot(this.leanX, this.leanZ); } };\n}\nexport function stepBal(b, dt = 1 / 120) {\n  const { body, G, K, D, ph, t, sway, tremor } = b;\n  const r = 1 - Math.exp(-b.reflex * dt);\n  b.wx += (b.wishX - b.wx) * r; b.wz += (b.wishZ - b.wz) * r;\n  const tx = b.wx * b.maxLean, tz = b.wz * b.maxLean;\n  const q = body.rotation();\n  const ux = 2 * (q.x * q.y - q.w * q.z), uy = 1 - 2 * (q.x * q.x + q.z * q.z), uz = 2 * (q.y * q.z + q.w * q.x);\n  b.leanX = Math.atan2(ux, uy); b.leanZ = Math.atan2(uz, uy);\n  const w = body.angvel();\n  let Tx = -(G * Math.sin(tx) + K * (b.leanX - tx)) + D * w.z;\n  let Tz = -(G * Math.sin(tz) + K * (b.leanZ - tz)) - D * w.x;\n  const limit = b.ankleMax * (b.flailLeft > 0 ? b.flailBoost : 1);\n  const m = Math.hypot(Tx, Tz); if (m > limit) { Tx *= limit / m; Tz *= limit / m; }\n  const nx = sway * (Math.sin(t * 0.9 + ph) * 0.6 + Math.sin(t * 1.73 + ph * 2.1) * 0.4) + tremor * (Math.sin(t * 8.2 + 1.1) * 0.6 + Math.sin(t * 18.3) * 0.4) + b.extX;\n  const nz = sway * (Math.sin(t * 0.77 + ph * 1.7) * 0.6 + Math.sin(t * 1.51 + ph * 0.6) * 0.4) + tremor * (Math.sin(t * 7.1 + 2.3) * 0.6 + Math.sin(t * 15.7 + 0.7) * 0.4) + b.extZ;\n  body.resetTorques(true);\n  body.addTorque(V(Tz + nz, -w.y * 0.6, -(Tx + nx)), true);\n  b.flailLeft = Math.max(0, b.flailLeft - dt); b.flailCd = Math.max(0, b.flailCd - dt); b.t += dt;\n}\nexport function flail(b) { if (b.flailCd <= 0) { b.flailLeft = 0.35; b.flailCd = 2; b.flails++; return true; } return false; }\nexport function resetDoll(b) { b.body.setRotation({ x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 1 }, true); const f = b.footBody.translation(); b.body.setTranslation(V(f.x, f.y + 0.75, f.z), true); b.body.setLinvel(V(), true); b.body.setAngvel(V(), true); b.wx = b.wz = 0; }\nexport function human(delay, gain, noise, seed) { const buf = []; let t = 0; return (dot, goal, dt = 1 / 120) => { t += dt; buf.push({ x: dot.x, y: dot.y }); const n = Math.max(1, Math.round(delay / dt)); while (buf.length > n) buf.shift(); const d = buf[0]; return { x: goal.x + gain * (goal.x - d.x) + noise * Math.sin(t * 2.7 + seed), y: goal.y + gain * (goal.y - d.y) + noise * Math.sin(t * 2.1 + seed * 2) }; }; }\nexport const clampDisc = (a) => { const L = Math.hypot(a.x, a.y); return L > 1 ? { x: a.x / L, y: a.y / L } : a; };\nexport const PLAYERS = { sharp: { delay: 0.16, gain: 1.4, noise: 0, lag: 0.12, err: 0.3, jitter: 28 }, average: { delay: 0.26, gain: 1.0, noise: 0.03, lag: 0.28, err: 0.8, jitter: 55 }, clumsy: { delay: 0.38, gain: 0.8, noise: 0.07, lag: 0.5, err: 1.4, jitter: 95 } };\nexport const under = { sharp: { delay: 0.16, gain: 0.7, noise: 0 }, average: { delay: 0.26, gain: 0.55, noise: 0.03 }, clumsy: { delay: 0.38, gain: 0.45, noise: 0.08 } };\nexport const avg = (a) => a.reduce((s, x) => s + x, 0) / a.length;\nEOF\ncat > kb.mjs <<'EOF'\n// Keyboard parity. Two candidate key models, played by a key-pressing bot with a delay and a deadband.\nimport { RAPIER, V, rad, deg, rng, avg, makeWorld, makeBalancer, stepBal, human, clampDisc, PLAYERS, under, DOLL, PROP } from './bal.mjs';\nfunction keys(model) {\n  // returns a function(pressX, pressZ, dt) -> wish; press is -1, 0 or 1 on each axis\n  let x = 0, z = 0;\n  const up = 1 / 0.45, down = 1 / 0.25, nudge = 1.1;\n  const ramp = (v, p, dt) => p !== 0 ? Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, v + p * up * dt)) : (Math.abs(v) < down * dt ? 0 : v - Math.sign(v) * down * dt);\n  return (px, pz, dt) => {\n    if (model === 'ramp') { x = ramp(x, px, dt); z = ramp(z, pz, dt); }\n    else { x = Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, x + px * nudge * dt)); z = Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, z + pz * nudge * dt)); }\n    return { x, y: z };\n  };\n}\nfunction keyBot(skill, model, seed) {\n  const P = PLAYERS[skill], buf = []; let px = 0, pz = 0, cool = 0; const r = rng(seed * 3);\n  const dead = { sharp: 0.035, average: 0.06, clumsy: 0.1 }[skill];\n  const minPress = { sharp: 0.05, average: 0.08, clumsy: 0.11 }[skill];\n  let holdX = 0, holdZ = 0;\n  return (dot, goal, dt) => {\n    buf.push({ x: dot.x, y: dot.y }); while (buf.length > Math.max(1, Math.round(P.delay / dt))) buf.shift(); const d = buf[0];\n    const ex = goal.x - d.x, ez = goal.y - d.y;\n    holdX -= dt; holdZ -= dt;\n    if (holdX <= 0) { const want = Math.abs(ex) > dead ? Math.sign(ex) : 0; if (want !== px) { px = want; holdX = minPress; } }\n    if (holdZ <= 0) { const want = Math.abs(ez) > dead ? Math.sign(ez) : 0; if (want !== pz) { pz = want; holdZ = minPress; } }\n    return [px, pz];\n  };\n}\n// ---- Poses\nconst POSES = [[-0.35, 0], [0, 0.4], [0, -0.35], [0.4, 0], [0.35, 0.2]];\nfunction poses(cfg, skill, seed, input) {\n  const world = makeWorld(8), b = makeBalancer(world, { maxLeanDeg: 14, ph: seed });\n  const P = PLAYERS[skill], stick = human(P.delay, P.gain, P.noise, seed), kbot = keyBot(skill, input, seed), kb = keys(input);\n  let w = 0, mw = 0; const dt = 1 / 120; let from = { x: 0, y: 0 };\n  for (const [gx, gy] of POSES.slice(0, cfg.poses)) {\n    for (let s = 0; s < (3 + cfg.hold) * 120; s++) {\n      const t = s / 120, e0 = Math.min(1, t / 3), e = e0 * e0 * (3 - 2 * e0), goal = { x: from.x + (gx - from.x) * e, y: from.y + (gy - from.y) * e }, dot = b.cob, h = Math.max(0, t - 3), f = Math.min(1, h / cfg.hold);\n      const rr = 0.3 + (cfg.ring - 0.3) * f; b.sway = cfg.sw[0] + (cfg.sw[1] - cfg.sw[0]) * f; b.tremor = cfg.tr[0] + (cfg.tr[1] - cfg.tr[0]) * f;\n      if (input === 'stick') { const a = clampDisc(stick(dot, goal)); b.wishX = a.x; b.wishZ = a.y; } else { const [px, pz] = kbot(dot, goal, dt); const a = clampDisc(kb(px, pz, dt)); b.wishX = a.x; b.wishZ = a.y; }\n      stepBal(b); world.step();\n      const weight = 0.3 / rr; if (t > 1.5) { mw += weight; if (Math.hypot(dot.x - goal.x, dot.y - goal.y) <= rr) w += weight; }\n    }\n    from = { x: gx, y: gy };\n  }\n  world.free(); return (100 * w) / mw;\n}\nconst T1 = { poses: 3, hold: 8, ring: 0.16, sw: [0.08, 0.22], tr: [0.08, 0.2] }, T2 = { poses: 4, hold: 10, ring: 0.13, sw: [0.12, 0.3], tr: [0.1, 0.3] };\nconsole.log('POSES form: stick vs keys');\nfor (const [n, c] of [['T1', T1], ['T2', T2]]) for (const input of ['stick', 'ramp', 'nudge']) console.log(' ', n, input.padEnd(6), ['sharp', 'average', 'clumsy'].map((sk) => `${sk} ${avg([1, 2, 3].map((s) => poses(c, sk, s, input))).toFixed(0)}`).join(' | '));\n// ---- Still Water\nfunction still(cfg, skill, seed, input) {\n  const world = makeWorld(8), b = makeBalancer(world, { ph: seed }); const U = under[skill], stick = human(U.delay, U.gain, U.noise * 0.5, seed), kbot = keyBot(skill, input, seed), kb = keys(input);\n  let calm = 0, zt = 0; const dt = 1 / 120, secs = 60;\n  for (let s = 0; s < secs * 120; s++) {\n    const t = s / 120; b.sway = cfg.sw[0] + (cfg.sw[1] - cfg.sw[0]) * (t / secs); b.tremor = 0.05; const dot = b.cob;\n    if (input === 'stick') { const a = clampDisc(stick(dot, { x: 0, y: 0 })); b.wishX = a.x; b.wishZ = a.y; } else { const [px, pz] = kbot(dot, { x: 0, y: 0 }, dt); const a = clampDisc(kb(px, pz, dt)); b.wishX = a.x; b.wishZ = a.y; }\n    stepBal(b); world.step(); const inZ = Math.hypot(dot.x, dot.y) <= cfg.zone; calm = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, calm + (inZ ? 1 / 30 : -1 / 8) * dt)); if (inZ) zt += dt;\n  }\n  world.free(); return 100 * (zt / secs + calm) / 2;\n}\nconsole.log('STILL WATER T1 form: stick vs keys');\nfor (const input of ['stick', 'ramp', 'nudge']) console.log(' ', input.padEnd(6), ['sharp', 'average', 'clumsy'].map((sk) => `${sk} ${avg([1, 2, 3].map((s) => still({ zone: 0.15, sw: [0.07, 0.18] }, sk, s, input))).toFixed(0)}`).join(' | '));\n// ---- Cairn T2\nconst sizes = [[0.26, 0.09], [0.24, 0.085], [0.22, 0.08], [0.2, 0.078], [0.18, 0.074], [0.165, 0.07], [0.15, 0.066], [0.14, 0.062]];\nfunction cairn(skill, seed, input) {\n  const world = makeWorld(10), b = makeBalancer(world, { margin: 0.8, ankleMax: 6, ph: seed });\n  world.createCollider(RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(0.55, 0.03, 0.55).setTranslation(0, 0.95, 0).setMass(0.05).setFriction(1).setCollisionGroups(DOLL), b.body);\n  const r = rng(seed * 2654435761), U = under[skill], stick = human(U.delay, U.gain, U.noise, seed), kbot = keyBot(skill, input, seed), kb = keys(input), stones = []; let placed = 0, next = 1; const every = 5, count = 8, total = count * every + 11, dt = 1 / 120;\n  for (let s = 0; s < total * 120; s++) {\n    const t = s / 120, f = t / total;\n    if (t >= next && placed < count) { next += every; const [r0, hh] = sizes[placed]; const q = b.body.rotation(), p = b.body.translation(); const ux = 2 * (q.x * q.y - q.w * q.z), uy = 1 - 2 * (q.x * q.x + q.z * q.z), uz = 2 * (q.y * q.z + q.w * q.x); const sl = { x: p.x + ux * 0.98, y: p.y + uy * 0.98, z: p.z + uz * 0.98 }; const live = stones.filter((st) => st.translation().y > 1.3); const top = live.length ? live.reduce((m, st) => (st.translation().y > m.translation().y ? st : m)) : null; const y = (top ? top.translation().y + top.hh : sl.y) + hh + 0.012, cx = top ? top.translation().x : sl.x, cz = top ? top.translation().z : sl.z;\n      const d = world.createRigidBody(RAPIER.RigidBodyDesc.dynamic().setTranslation(cx + (r() - 0.5) * 0.04, y, cz + (r() - 0.5) * 0.04).setLinearDamping(0.1).setAngularDamping(0.6).setCanSleep(false)); world.createCollider(RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(r0 * 0.8, hh, r0 * 0.8).setMass(0.02).setFriction(0.95).setRestitution(0).setCollisionGroups(PROP), d); d.hh = hh; stones.push(d); placed++; }\n    b.sway = 0.15 + 0.25 * f; b.tremor = 0.08 + 0.12 * f; const dot = b.cob;\n    if (input === 'stick') { const a = clampDisc(stick(dot, { x: 0, y: 0 })); b.wishX = a.x; b.wishZ = a.y; } else { const [px, pz] = kbot(dot, { x: 0, y: 0 }, dt); const a = clampDisc(kb(px, pz, dt)); b.wishX = a.x; b.wishZ = a.y; }\n    stepBal(b); world.step();\n  }\n  const on = stones.filter((st) => st.translation().y > 1.3).length; world.free(); return on;\n}\nconsole.log('CAIRN T2 stones of 8, no breath: stick vs keys');\nfor (const input of ['stick', 'ramp', 'nudge']) console.log(' ', input.padEnd(6), ['sharp', 'average', 'clumsy'].map((sk) => `${sk} ${avg([1, 2, 3].map((s) => cairn(sk, s, input))).toFixed(1)}`).join(' | '));\nEOF\nnode kb.mjs 2>&1 | grep -v deprecated","description":"Simulate keyboard weight control against the stick","timeout":420000}}}
